msgid "저희 빌라 옥상 문이요, 원래 잠가 둬요? 자물쇠가 채워져 있던데."
msgstr "我们楼的天台门，平时都锁着吗？我看挂着锁。"

#. Key:	NarinRepeatQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2190)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2190)
