msgstr "还能想起别的什么吗？"

#. Key:	NarinFirstQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2191)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2191)
