msgstr "天台？听说去年夏天房东大叔把锁全换了。钥匙大概只有管理室才有吧。"

#. Key:	NarinLineMidWeek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2563)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2563)
