msgstr "还没有消息吗？我也问了几个老顾客，都说最近没见过他。"

#. Key:	NarinRepeatAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2570)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2570)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRepeatAnswer"
