msgstr "有信号了。先给112发短信。"

#. Key:	FirstReportSent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3531)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(3531)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FirstReportSent"
