#. Key:	NightFourAnnexDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4499)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4499)
