msgstr "［手机呼叫失败的提示音］"

#. Key:	NoSignalThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4558)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4558)
