msgid "폰도 안 터지네."
msgstr "手机也没信号。"

#. Key:	Hwang401PeekCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4639)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4639)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401PeekCaption"
msgid "401호 문 살짝 열리는 소리"
msgstr "401室的门开了条缝的声音"

#. Key:	HwangSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4675)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4675)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,HwangSpeaker"
msgid "황순금"
msgstr "黄顺今"

#. Key:	Hwang401Peek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4676)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4676)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Peek"
msgid "새벽에 나와 있었죠? 들어가서 눈 좀 붙여요."
msgstr "天没亮你就出来了吧？进屋眯一会儿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Greeting
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4722)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4722)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Greeting"
msgid "403호 새로 온 아가씨죠? 밤엔 문 좀 살살 닫아 줘요. 여기 소리가 잘 울려서."
msgstr "403室新搬来的？鞋柜门关轻点。夜里什么声音都听得见。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4738)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4738)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP5"
msgid "내일 아침에 또 벽을 막는대요. 물탱크 청소할 땐 배관 소리가 어찌나 큰지, 벽을 쳐도 안 들리던데."
msgstr "听说明天早上又要把墙封上。清洗水箱的那天凌晨，水管震得满墙都响，就算有人砸墙也没人知道。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4746)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4746)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP4"
msgid "벽이 하도 울길래 나도 똑같이 두드려 줬어요. 그랬더니 그날 밤은 조용하더라고요."
msgstr "墙一直响个不停，我也照着敲了回去。结果那天夜里就安静了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4754)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4754)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP3"
msgid "관리인 없어요? 열쇠는 늘 책상 위에 두던데. 못 들어가게 하면 나한테 말해요."
msgstr "管理员不在？钥匙他一直放在桌上。要是不让你进，就跟我说。"

#. Key:	Hwang401AfterT7
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4762)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4762)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401AfterT7"
msgid "그날도 들었어요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "那天我也听见了。都说那儿没人，可我明明听见了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4773)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4773)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP2"
msgid "몇 번을 전화했는데 맨날 배관 소리래요. 장부에 적기는 했나 좀 봐 줘요."
msgstr "因为那声音，我给管理室打了好几回电话，他就说是水管。你帮我看看他在台账上是怎么写的。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4781)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4781)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP1"
msgid "전기 나갔으면 1층 계량기함 봐요. 검침표도 거기 붙어 있어요."
msgstr "停电了就去看一楼的电表箱。抄表记录也贴在那儿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Neutral
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4788)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4788)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Neutral"
msgid "잠은 좀 잤어요? 물이라도 한 잔 마시고 가요."
msgstr "睡了一会儿没有？好歹喝杯水再走。"

#. Key:	Arrival401PrayerStops
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4841)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4841)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival401PrayerStops"
msgid "안에서 들리던 불경 소리가 멈춘다"
msgstr "里面的念经声停了"

#. Key:	Hwang401JournalGiven
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4924)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4924)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401JournalGiven"
msgid "문고리에 걸어 둔 거 읽어 봐요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "我挂在门把手上的东西，你看看。都说那儿没人，可我明明听见了。"

#. Key:	YudamToHwangAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4970)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4970)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamToHwangAnswer"
msgid "벽 안에서 대답이 왔어요. 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 오빠가 문 두드리던 박자예요."
msgstr "墙里有回应了。两下，停一下，再一下。是我哥敲门的节奏。"

#. Key:	Hwang401IsItYourBrother
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4980)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4980)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401IsItYourBrother"
msgid "그게 아가씨 오빠였어요?"
msgstr "姑娘，那是你哥哥吗？"

#. Key:	Hwang401Permission
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4987)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4987)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Permission"
msgid "꺼내 줘요. 물 필요하면 써요. 그깟 물값, 내가 낼 테니까."
msgstr "把他带出来吧。水箱的水尽管放。水费我来出。"

#. Key:	NightFourWallNeedsCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5043)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5043)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourWallNeedsCover"
msgid "지금 치면 건물 사람들이 다 듣겠어. 소리를 덮을 게 필요해."
msgstr "现在砸的话，整栋楼的人都会听见。得有别的声音盖住才行。"

#. Key:	SettlePipe
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(605)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(605)
