#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshopHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(508)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(508)
