#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshopFootnote
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(513)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(513)
