#. Key:	EpilogueTuningCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(545)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(545)
