#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(599)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueCardA"
msgid "조율이 끝난 방"
msgstr "调好音的房间"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayHeading
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(620)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(620)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayHeading"
msgid "오빠를 꺼낸 날, 5층"
msgstr "接哥出来的那天，五楼"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBayFootnote
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(625)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(625)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBayFootnote"
msgid "소리 일지는 401호 할머니께 돌려드렸다"
msgstr "声音记录还给了401室的奶奶"

#. Key:	EpilogueKeyDropCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(643)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(643)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueKeyDropCaption"
msgid "[열쇠가 반납함 바닥에 떨어지는 소리]"
msgstr "［钥匙掉进归还箱底的声音］"

#. Key:	EpilogueFinalKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(666)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(666)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueFinalKnockCaption"
msgid "[위] 둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "［上方］两下，停一下，再一下"

#. Key:	EpilogueRailingCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(686)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(686)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueRailingCaption"
msgid "[난간을 두 번 두드리는 소리]"
msgstr "［敲两下栏杆的声音］"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsHeadingB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(696)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(696)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsHeadingB"
msgid "뉴스"
msgstr "新闻"

#. Key:	EpilogueCardB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(706)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(706)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueCardB"
msgid "같이 있던 밤"
msgstr "陪你的那一夜"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(725)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(725)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop1"
msgid "오빠가 쓰던 작업표가 아직 여기 있네."
msgstr "哥用过的工作单还在这儿。"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(729)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(729)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop2"
msgid "업라이트 1대  ·  받는 분 백유담  ·  집들이 전에 전달"
msgstr "立式钢琴1台  ·  收货人 白侑潭  ·  乔迁前送到"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(734)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(734)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop3"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 쥐어 본다. 손잡이 한쪽이 닳아 있다."
msgstr "握了握调音扳手。手柄有一侧磨旧了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(745)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(745)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1"
msgid "5층을 뜯어내고 있다. 크레인이 하루 종일 골목을 막고 서 있다."
msgstr "五楼正在拆。吊车一整天都堵在巷子里。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(754)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(754)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy"
msgid "402호에 불이 켜져 있다. 냉장고 소리가 복도까지 들린다."
msgstr "402室亮着灯。走廊里都能听见冰箱的声音。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(763)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(763)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2Seen"
msgid "물그릇이 있던 401호 앞을 지난다. 창턱에 작은 라디오가 놓여 있다."
msgstr "经过以前放水碗的401室门口。窗台上放着一台小收音机。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(770)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(770)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2"
msgid "401호 창턱에 작은 라디오가 창밖을 향해 놓여 있다."
msgstr "401室的窗台上，一台小收音机朝着窗外摆着。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Radio
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(780)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(780)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Radio"
msgid "문 너머로 듣던 그 불경 소리다. 창밖으로 들리게 틀어 놓으셨네."
msgstr "是以前隔着门听过的念经声。奶奶开着收音机，好让窗外也听得见。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(787)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(787)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Seen"
msgid "라디오를 창밖 쪽으로 돌려놓으셨다. 골목까지 들리겠다."
msgstr "奶奶把收音机转向了窗外。巷子里都能听见吧。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(799)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(799)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1"
msgid "방수포도 카트도 치워졌다. 콘크리트에 자국만 남았다."
msgstr "防水布和推车都清走了。水泥地上只剩下痕迹。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(804)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(804)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1b"
msgid "관리실 창은 그날 밤 뒤로 불이 한 번도 안 켜졌다."
msgstr "那晚之后，管理室的窗户再也没亮过灯。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(810)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(810)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay2"
msgid "그 뒤로 새벽 두 번을 401호 할머니와 벽 앞에서 같이 대답했다."
msgstr "后来又有两个凌晨，我和401室的奶奶一起对着墙回应。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(817)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(817)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay3Seen"
msgid "옥상 탱크 옆, 오빠가 쉬던 자리는 아직 그대로다."
msgstr "天台水箱旁边，哥歇脚的地方还是老样子。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(823)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(823)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay4"
msgid "방을 빼고 403호 열쇠를 돌려줬다."
msgstr "退了房，交还了403室的钥匙。"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(837)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(837)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews1"
msgid "무영로 다세대주택 벽체에서 남성 유해 발견 … 실종 1년 만"
msgstr "无影路一住宅楼墙内发现男性遗骸……失踪已满一年"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(846)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(846)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokB"
msgid "건물주 목씨 소재 파악 중… 관리실 비운 채 연락 끊겨"
msgstr "房东睦某下落不明……管理室人去楼空，本人失联"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokA
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(850)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(850)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokA"
msgid "경찰, 건물주 목씨 상대로 사건 경위 조사"
msgstr "警方就事发经过对房东睦某展开调查"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(859)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(859)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3Seen"
msgid "관리실 안쪽 방은 방음 시공돼 있었다"
msgstr "管理室里屋做过隔音处理"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(866)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(866)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3"
msgid "민원 대장 두 벌과 이틀치 자재 영수증이 확보됐다"
msgstr "警方已调取两本投诉台账及两天的建材收据"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(877)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(877)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Seen"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 “그 뒤로 새벽마다 깼다”며 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "前租客徐某称“那之后每天凌晨都会醒”，表示愿意到案说明情况"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(884)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(884)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 변호인을 통해 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "前租客徐某通过律师表示愿意到案说明情况"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(895)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(895)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Recorder"
msgid "건물 녹화 장치는 저장 디스크가 빠진 채로 발견됐다"
msgstr "该楼的监控录像机被发现时，存储硬盘已被拆走"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Calendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(904)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(904)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Calendar"
msgid "관리실 벽 달력은 지난해 7월 26일에 표시된 채 멈춰 있었다"
msgstr "管理室墙上的挂历停在去年7月，26日那天画着记号"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Roster
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(916)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(916)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Roster"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 사건 당일 야간 근무 중 들은 소리를 진술했다"
msgstr "附近便利店店员陈述了案发当天值夜班时听到的声音"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Parcel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(924)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(924)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Parcel"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 실종자의 택배를 건물주가 찾아갔다고 진술했다"
msgstr "附近便利店店员称，失踪者的快递曾被房东取走"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(931)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(931)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원의 목격 진술을 토대로 당시 행적을 확인 중이다"
msgstr "警方正根据附近便利店店员的目击陈述，核实当时的行踪"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionStart
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(293)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(293)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionStart"
