msgstr "［7月27日 · 近处］浅浅的呼吸声  ·  ［右侧］流水声"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionWaterShift
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(351)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(351)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionWaterShift"
msgid "[머리 위] 배관 크게 덜컹거리는 소리"
msgstr "［正上方］水管剧烈震动的声音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionSecondDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(369)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(369)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionSecondDawn"
msgid "[7월 28일] 발소리와 불경 소리가 점점 멀어진다"
msgstr "［7月28日］脚步声和念经声渐渐远去"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionThirdDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(437)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(437)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionThirdDawn"
msgid "[7월 29일] 벽을 긁는 소리"
msgstr "［7月29日］挠墙的声音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionDohaCall
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(489)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(489)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionDohaCall"
msgid "[벽 안] 둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "［墙里］两下，停一下，再一下"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionHwangReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(508)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(508)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionHwangReply"
msgid "[아주 멀리] 같은 박자로 대답하는 소리"
msgstr "［很远处］同样节奏的回应声"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionFourthDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(528)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(528)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionFourthDawn"
msgid "[7월 30일] 느리고 약한 숨소리"
msgstr "［7月30日］又慢又弱的呼吸声"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionFinalDawn
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(541)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(541)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionFinalDawn"
msgid "[7월 31일] 다섯 번째 새벽"
msgstr "［7月31日］第五个凌晨"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionNoReply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(558)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(558)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionNoReply"
msgid "[벽 안] 두 번 두드리는 소리  ·  대답 없음"
msgstr "［墙里］两下敲击声  ·  没有回应"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionBreathOnly
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(575)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(575)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FifthDawnCaptionBreathOnly"
msgid "[가까이] 희미한 숨소리"
msgstr "［近处］微弱的呼吸声"

#. Key:	FinalRevealBegin
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1349)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1349)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealBegin"
msgid "위에서부터 천천히 비춰 본다."
msgstr "从上往下，慢慢照过去。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealSkull
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1426)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1426)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealSkull"
msgid "고개가 옷깃 쪽으로 푹 숙여져 있다."
msgstr "头深深地垂到了衣领上。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealRibs
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1454)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1454)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealRibs"
msgid "갈비뼈 사이에 석고 가루가 쌓여 있다. 오래됐어."
msgstr "肋骨之间积着石膏粉。很久了。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealShoes
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1500)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1500)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealShoes"
msgid "한쪽 발이 안으로 꺾여 있다. 방수포, 카트 바퀴… 오빠야."
msgstr "一只脚向里折着。防水布，推车轮子……是哥。"

#. Key:	FinalRevealKnockCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1656)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1656)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalRevealKnockCaption"
msgid "멀리서 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "远处传来两下敲击声"

#. Key:	MokHansooFinalLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1701)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1701)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooFinalLine"
msgid "그만해요. 덮어야 돼. 이거… 말해 봤자 아무도 안 믿어요."
msgstr "别弄了。得封上。这事……说出去也没人信。"

#. Key:	MokHansooName
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1707)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1707)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokHansooName"
msgid "목한수"
msgstr "睦汉洙"

#. Key:	YudamName
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1722)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1722)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamName"
msgid "백유담"
msgstr "白侑潭"

#. Key:	FinaleDragCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1873)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1873)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinaleDragCaption"
msgid "석고 가루 위로 무겁게 끌리는 소리"
msgstr "重物拖过石膏粉的声音"

#. Key:	FinalConfrontationAfter
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1970)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(1970)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FinalConfrontationAfter"
msgid "나를 지나쳐서 관리인을 따라갔어."
msgstr "他从我身边过去，跟着管理员走了。"

#. Key:	MokRetreatStepsCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2030)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2030)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MokRetreatStepsCaption"
msgid "뒷걸음치는 발소리"
msgstr "往后退的脚步声"

#. Key:	EvictionPostedCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2115)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2115)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionPostedCaption"
msgid "4층 복도에서 종이 붙이는 소리"
msgstr "四楼走廊里贴纸的声音"

#. Key:	CleaningDrainThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2209)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2209)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CleaningDrainThought"
msgid "아래쪽 배관으로 물이 빠진다."
msgstr "水从下面的管子排出去了。"

#. Key:	FloatBypassThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2211)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2211)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FloatBypassThought"
msgid "급수관에서도 물소리가 난다."
msgstr "供水管里也有水声了。"

#. Key:	TransferPumpThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2212)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2212)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TransferPumpThought"
msgid "펌프가 돌기 시작했다."
msgstr "抽水泵开始转了。"

#. Key:	P5OverflowAlarm
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2274)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2274)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P5OverflowAlarm"
msgid "물이 넘친다. 배수 밸브를 안 열었어."
msgstr "水溢出来了。排水阀没开。"

#. Key:	P5PressureAlarm
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2278)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2278)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P5PressureAlarm"
msgid "펌프가 멈췄다. 고장등 꺼질 때까지 기다리자."
msgstr "抽水泵停了。等故障灯灭了再说。"

#. Key:	P5MaskReady
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2483)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2483)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P5MaskReady"
msgid "물 도는 동안엔 벽 치는 소리가 묻히겠다."
msgstr "水流着的时候，砸墙声会被盖过去。"

#. Key:	NightFourRecordingArmed
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2495)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2495)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourRecordingArmed"
msgid "폰 녹음 켜 두자. 이번엔 뭐라도 남겨야 해."
msgstr "先把手机录音打开。这次一定得留下点什么。"

#. Key:	NightFourRecordingLifted
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2539)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2539)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourRecordingLifted"
msgid "폰을 보니 방금 그 소리가 다 찍혀 있다."
msgstr "看了看手机，刚才的声音全都录下来了。"

#. Key:	P2PhoneKept
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2546)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2546)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P2PhoneKept"
msgid "녹음됐다. 이번엔 제대로 됐어."
msgstr "录下来了。这次没问题。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2676)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2676)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourStrikeFirst"
msgid "석고에 금이 갔다."
msgstr "石膏板裂了道缝。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeSecond
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2678)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2678)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourStrikeSecond"
msgid "안이 비었어. 소리가 달라."
msgstr "里面是空的。声音不一样。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeFourth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2679)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2679)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourStrikeFourth"
msgid "손이 저리다. 한 번만 더."
msgstr "手都震麻了。再来一下。"

#. Key:	Unit401ReplyCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2711)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2711)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Unit401ReplyCaption"
msgid "둘, 쉬고, 하나"
msgstr "两下，停一下，再一下"

#. Key:	NightFourPowerCut
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2794)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2794)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourPowerCut"
msgid "불이 나갔어. 밑에 누가 있어."
msgstr "灯灭了。楼下有人。"

#. Key:	BreakerCutCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2800)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2800)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,BreakerCutCaption"
msgid "차단기 내리는 소리"
msgstr "拉下电闸的声音"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyFoam
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2942)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2942)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyFoam"
msgid "관리실 안쪽 방이요. 문틈까지 계란판 붙여 놓으셨더라고요."
msgstr "管理室的里屋。您连门缝都贴满了鸡蛋托。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyCalendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2949)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2949)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyCalendar"
msgid "달력이요. 26일에 동그라미 치고, 그 뒤로 한 장도 안 넘기셨죠."
msgstr "挂历。您在26号画了个圈，之后一页都没翻过吧。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyGlove
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2956)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2956)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyGlove"
msgid "5층에 장갑 한 짝 있던데요. 오빠 손엔 두 치수 커요."
msgstr "五楼有一只手套。我哥戴的话，大了两个号。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyRecorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2963)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2963)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyRecorder"
msgid "녹화기 하드는 언제 빼셨어요?"
msgstr "录像机的硬盘，您是什么时候拆的？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyInnerRoom
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2970)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2970)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyInnerRoom"
msgid "안쪽 방에 뭘 계속 돌려 놓으셨던데요. 그래서 못 들으셨어요?"
msgstr "您在里屋一直开着什么东西。所以才没听见吗？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyWind
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2977)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2977)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyWind"
msgid "옥상에서 바람 들어 봤어요. 바람이 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 불어요?"
msgstr "我在天台听过风声。风会吹出两下，停一下，再一下吗？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2988)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2988)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyPack"
msgid "탱크 옆에 꽁초 여섯 개요. 거기 앉아서 쉬던 사람이 있었다고요."
msgstr "水箱边上有六个烟头。有人在那儿坐着歇过脚。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyBowl
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2995)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2995)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyBowl"
msgid "401호 할머니는 아직도 물그릇을 갈아 놓으세요. 매일요."
msgstr "401室的奶奶到现在还在给水碗换水。天天都换。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPills
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3002)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3002)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyPills"
msgid "골목에 떨어진 약봉투에 서일영 씨 이름이 있었어요."
msgstr "巷子里掉的那个药袋上，写着徐一英的名字。"

#. Key:	EndingBRecordingOffCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3157)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3157)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBRecordingOffCaption"
msgid "폰 녹음 끄는 소리"
msgstr "关掉手机录音的声音"

#. Key:	EndingAChoiceThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3165)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3165)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingAChoiceThought"
msgid "여기 내려놓자. 밖에 나가서 사람을 불러야 해."
msgstr "放在这儿吧。得出去叫人来。"

#. Key:	EndingBChoiceThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3169)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3169)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBChoiceThought"
msgid "조금만 더 여기 있을게."
msgstr "我在这儿再待一会儿。"

#. Key:	EndingBAnswerCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3373)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3373)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBAnswerCaption"
msgid "복도 끝에서 대답하듯 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "走廊尽头传来两下敲击声，像在回应"

#. Key:	EndingBRingbackCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3455)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3455)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBRingbackCaption"
msgid "112 연결음"
msgstr "呼叫112的等待音"

#. Key:	EndingCCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3644)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3644)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingCCaption"
msgid "아주 가까이서, 똑같이 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "很近的地方，一模一样的两下敲击声"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(421)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(421)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticePrompt"
msgid "퇴거 통보문 읽기"
msgstr "看退租通知"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(425)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(425)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticeThought"
msgid "이번 주 안에 나가라고? 내가 밤에 올라간 걸 아는 거야."
msgstr "说我擅自操作设施，让我这周之内搬走。他知道我晚上上去过。"

#. Key:	CleaningDrainPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(440)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(440)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CleaningDrainPrompt"
msgid "세척 배수 밸브 열기"
msgstr "打开排水阀"

#. Key:	FloatBypassPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(453)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(453)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FloatBypassPrompt"
msgid "우회 밸브 열기"
msgstr "打开旁通阀"

#. Key:	TransferPumpPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(472)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(472)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TransferPumpPrompt"
msgid "이송 펌프 수동으로 돌리기"
msgstr "手动启动抽水泵"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheetPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(496)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(496)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheetPrompt"
msgid "저수조 점검 메모"
msgstr "水箱检修备忘"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheetTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(498)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(498)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheetTitle"
msgid "저수조 점검 메모 (2019.03)"
msgstr "水箱检修备忘（2019.03）"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(500)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(500)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet1"
msgid "물이 넘친 날: 배수는 잠겨 있었고, 우회만 열려 있었음."
msgstr "溢水那天：排水阀关着，只开了旁通阀。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(501)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(501)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet2"
msgid "펌프가 멎은 날: 배수만 열고 돌림. 우회관에 물이 안 찼음."
msgstr "泵停那天：只开了排水阀就启动。旁通管里没进水。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(502)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(502)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet3"
msgid "세척할 때는 자동 수위 조절을 쓰지 말 것."
msgstr "清洗时不要用自动水位调节。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(504)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(504)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet4"
msgid "고장등이 켜지면 손대지 말고 10초 정도 기다리세요."
msgstr "故障灯亮时别动，等10秒左右。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(505)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(505)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet5"
msgid "배관이 조용해지고 등이 꺼진 뒤 다시 돌리면 됩니다."
msgstr "等管道安静下来、灯灭了，再启动就行。"

#. Key:	WallBreakPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(555)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(555)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,WallBreakPrompt"
msgid "벽을 망치로 두드리기"
msgstr "用锤子砸墙"

#. Key:	EndingAPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(573)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(573)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingAPrompt"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 오빠 곁에 두고 물러나기"
msgstr "把调音扳手放在哥身边，退后"

#. Key:	EndingBPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(587)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(587)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBPrompt"
msgid "녹음 끄고 곁에 앉아 대답하기"
msgstr "关掉录音，坐到他身边回应"

#. Key:	KeyringPaperThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1244)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1244)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KeyringPaperThought"
msgid "열쇠 옆에 부동산 문자 뽑아 둔 게 있네."
msgstr "钥匙旁边有张打印出来的中介短信。"

#. Key:	ValveOpenPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1265)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1265)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ValveOpenPrompt"
msgid "열린 배관 밸브"
msgstr "已打开的管道阀门"

#. Key:	ValveThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1314)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ValveThought"
msgid "물 내려가는 소리가 난다. 이제 벽에 귀를 대 보자."
msgstr "有水往下流的声音了。现在贴着墙听听看。"

#. Key:	TuningHammerArrivalEcho
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1424)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1424)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TuningHammerArrivalEcho"
msgid "이사 온 날 옥상 문 너머에서 들린 그 소리다."
msgstr "就是搬来那天，在天台门那边听到的声音。"

#. Key:	TuningHammerListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1440)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1440)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TuningHammerListingThought"
msgid "목록에 있던 공구다. 이것까지 팔지는 못했네."
msgstr "是二手信息里列过的工具。这件到底没卖出去。"

#. Key:	TunerCartThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1477)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1477)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TunerCartThought"
msgid "바퀴 하나가 깨졌네. 천장에서 들리던 소리랑 비슷하다."
msgstr "有个轮子坏了。声音和天花板上传来的有点像。"

#. Key:	AnnexRecognitionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1582)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1582)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,AnnexRecognitionThought"
msgid "CCTV에서 본 곳이다. 저 전구, 왼쪽으로 꺾이는 복도."
msgstr "是监控里看到的那条走廊。一个灯泡，往左拐的路。"

#. Key:	PlasterDatingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1604)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1604)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,PlasterDatingThought"
msgid "안쪽은 바싹 말랐는데, 바깥 실리콘은 덜 굳었어. 얼마 전에 또 막았나?"
msgstr "里层的石膏板已经干透了，外面的密封胶还没完全凝固。最近又封过一次？"

#. Key:	TankAuditionCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1653)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1653)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionCaption"
msgid "[안쪽] 물이 아주 천천히 흐르는 소리"
msgstr "［里面］非常缓慢的流水声"

#. Key:	TankAuditionThoughtCrossed
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1668)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1668)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionThoughtCrossed"
msgid "탱크에 물이 가득 찼다. 벽 바로 뒤로 배관이 지나가네."
msgstr "水箱里的水是满的。墙后面紧挨着就有管子经过。"

#. Key:	TankAuditionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1672)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1672)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionThought"
msgid "이 밑으로 급수관이 내려가네."
msgstr "供水管从这下面往下走。"

#. Key:	ListenSilent
