msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ForumTitle"
msgid "관리인께 드립니다"
msgstr "致管理员"

#. Key:	Forum1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(870)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(870)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum1"
msgid "6/30  새벽 네 시만 되면 위에서 뭘 질질 끕니다. 자다가 매번 깨요."
msgstr "6/30  一到凌晨四点，楼上就开始拖东西。每次都把我吵醒。"

#. Key:	Forum2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(871)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(871)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum2"
msgid "7/12  관리인은 창고라 사람이 없대요. 그럼 이 소리는 어디서 나는 건가요?"
msgstr "7/12  管理员说上面是仓库，没有人。那这声音是从哪儿来的？"

#. Key:	Forum3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(873)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(873)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum3"
msgid "7/26  03:12  어차피 네 시면 또 시작이에요. 오늘은 올라가 봅니다. 사람인지 뭔지 얼굴이나 보죠."
msgstr "7/26  03:12  反正一到四点又要开始。今天我上去一趟。是人还是别的什么，我倒要看看长什么样。"

#. Key:	Forum4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(874)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(874)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum4"
msgid "댓글 12  ·  참지 마세요 / 잘 생각하셨어요 / 가서 확실하게 말하세요"
msgstr "评论 12  ·  别忍了 / 早该这样了 / 上去把话说清楚"

#. Key:	JournalPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(901)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(901)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JournalPrompt"
msgid "달력 뒷장 소리 일지"
msgstr "挂历背面的声音记录"

#. Key:	JournalTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(903)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(903)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JournalTitle"
msgid "401호 황순금 소리 일지"
msgstr "401室 黄顺今 声音记录"

#. Key:	Journal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(905)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(905)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal1"
msgid "7/27  네 시 반쯤 또 깸. 위에서 다섯 번. 관리실 전화 안 받음."
msgstr "7/27  四点半左右又醒了。楼上五下。管理室没人接电话。"

#. Key:	Journal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(906)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(906)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal2"
msgid "7/28  또 다섯 번. 어제보다 힘이 없음."
msgstr "7/28  又是五下。比昨天没力气。"

#. Key:	Journal3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(907)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(907)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal3"
msgid "7/29  벽이 하도 울어서 나도 두드려 줬다. 저쪽이 하던 대로 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그랬더니 조용하데. 사람인가."
msgstr "7/29  墙响得太厉害，我也敲了回去。照那边的敲法，两下，停一下，再一下。这么一敲，就安静了。是人吗？"

#. Key:	Journal4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(908)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(908)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal4"
msgid "7/30  네 번 들음. 수도 틀자 안 들림."
msgstr "7/30  听到四下。一开水龙头就听不见了。"

#. Key:	Journal5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(909)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(909)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal5"
msgid "7/31  오늘은 세 번. 귀가 먹은 건지."
msgstr "7/31  今天三下。是我耳朵背了？"

#. Key:	Journal6
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(911)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(911)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal6"
msgid "8/1"
msgstr "8/1"

