msgstr "［门那边］布料摩擦的声音"

#. Key:	P2InnerRoomThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorPuzzleTwoDirector.cpp(1358)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorPuzzleTwoDirector.cpp(1358)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,P2InnerRoomThought"
msgid "안에서 누가 뒤척였어. 지금 문 열면 들킨다."
msgstr "里面有人翻了个身。现在开门会被发现。"

#. Key:	P2FoamThought
