#. Key:	AudioCalibrationTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6228)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6228)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationTitle"
msgid "소리와 밝기"
msgstr "声音与亮度"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationFirstRunSubtitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6235)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6235)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationFirstRunSubtitle"
msgid "시작하기 전에 소리 크기와 화면 밝기를 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "开始之前，请先调好音量和画面亮度。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationSubtitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6236)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6236)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationSubtitle"
msgid "헤드폰이나 모니터를 바꿨다면 다시 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "如果换了耳机或显示器，请重新调整。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationKnockLabel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6269)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6269)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationKnockLabel"
msgid "위층 노크 소리"
msgstr "楼上的敲击声"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationKnockInstruction
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6278)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6278)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationKnockInstruction"
msgid "노크가 또렷하게 들리면서도\n깜짝 놀라지 않을 만큼 맞춰 주세요."
msgstr "请把音量调到敲击声清晰可闻，\n又不至于吓一跳。"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationShadowLabel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6305)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6305)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationShadowLabel"
msgid "어두운 화면 확인"
msgstr "暗部检查"

#. Key:	AudioCalibrationShadowInstruction
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6314)
msgctxt "IGHUD,AudioCalibrationShadowInstruction"
msgid "가운데 칸이 희미하게 보이도록 맞춰 주세요.\n왼쪽 칸은 배경과 구분되지 않아야 합니다."
msgstr "请调到中间的方块隐约可见。\n左边的方块应与背景融为一体。"

#. Key:	AudioCal.MasterVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(6349)
